    "html": {
     "zh": "<div style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.ntust.edu.tw/var/file/0/1000/img/logo.png\" alt=\"NTUST\"><h2 style=\"color:#1a4f8b\">期中考試時間</h2><p>各位同學好：</p><p>本學期期中考試週將至，<b>各科考試時間</b>請留意各課程公告。</p><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px\">期中考試週</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px\">詳見學校行事曆</td></tr></table><p>教務處 敬啟</p></div>",
     "en": "<div style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.ntust.edu.tw/var/file/0/1000/img/logo.png\" alt=\"NTUST\"><h2 style=\"color:#1a4f8b\">Midterm exams</h2><p>Dear students,</p><p>Midterm week is coming up. Please check each course's announcements for <b>its exam time</b>.</p><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px\">Midterm week</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px\">See the academic calendar</td></tr></table><p>Office of Academic Affairs</p></div>"
    }
