      "intro": {
       "zh": "<p>實作一個 <strong>AVL 樹</strong>，支援插入、刪除與查詢，並與未平衡的二元搜尋樹比較效能。</p><ul><li>請附上測試程式與執行結果</li><li>報告以 PDF 繳交</li></ul>",
       "en": "<p>Implement an <strong>AVL tree</strong> with insert, delete and search, and compare its performance with an unbalanced binary search tree.</p><ul><li>Include your tests and their output</li><li>Submit the report as a PDF</li></ul>"
